  <Properties>
    <articleTitle>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[After hitting a tree, a 19-year-old was thrown from his car. He was the only survivor.]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="pl-PL"><![CDATA[Po uderzeniu w drzewo z auta wypadł 19-latek. Tylko on przeżył]]></Value>
    </articleTitle>
    <author>
      <Value><![CDATA[umb://document/833364f91e1e4f9a866584920b87dfba]]></Value>
    </author>
    <components>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "bc8cfc9b-08fe-4be1-8a61-49c6dedf32ba",
      "key": "6812b6d0-d35b-4f1f-a075-7eed23d0fc8c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "componentText",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWhile overtaking another vehicle, he lost control of the car, veered off the road, and struck a tree. The driver and one passenger died in the early morning accident on National Road 32.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe accident occurred around 6:00 a.m. on National Road 32 between Ptaszk\u00F3w and Kot\u00F3w. \u0022Preliminary police findings indicate that the 26-year-old driver of the Mazda failed to exercise due caution while overtaking, causing the car to strike a tree,\u0022 said Staff Sergeant Aleksandra Hoffmann from the District Police Headquarters in Grodzisk Wielkopolski.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ede3fd7a-2f08-469d-95c2-10791dfc795f",
      "key": "40b5b239-c885-409f-8005-7ecd7a71a364",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "imagePosition",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "left"
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EA 19-year-old man was ejected from his car, but he survived.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA 19-year-old man was ejected from his car after hitting a tree. He was taken to a hospital in Nowy Tomy\u015Bl.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA 26-year-old and a 23-year-old man died in the accident. Both were trapped in the vehicle.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFour fire crews, police, and paramedics responded to the scene.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
